flowchart TD
    A[Input folder] --> B[Ingest and validate]
    B -->|invalid| X[Error record]
    B --> C[Page text quality triage]
    C -->|usable text| D[Digital text and tables]
    C -->|missing or noisy| E[Render and preprocess]
    E --> F[Local OCR adapters]
    D --> G[Stitch tables]
    F --> G
    G --> H[Classify each page]
    H --> I[Group consecutive sections]
    I --> J[Rules and layout extraction]
    J --> K{Missing fields?}
    K -->|yes, configured| L[Grounded local LLM hook]
    K -->|no| M[Pydantic normalization]
    L --> M
    M --> N[Arithmetic validation]
    N --> O[Confidence and review flags]
    O --> P[JSON, CSV, summary]
